<div class="dg" data-tabs-scope>
  <div class="bar" data-tablist role="tablist" aria-label="切换关系模型">
    <button
      type="button"
      role="tab"
      id="dg-tab-topology"
      data-tab="topology"
      aria-selected="true"
    >拓扑 · 谁依赖谁</button>
    <button
      type="button"
      role="tab"
      id="dg-tab-sequence"
      data-tab="sequence"
      aria-selected="false"
    >时序 · 消息先后</button>
  </div>

  <div
    class="sheet"
    role="tabpanel"
    id="dg-panel-topology"
    data-panel="topology"
    aria-labelledby="dg-tab-topology"
  >
    <div class="sheet-surface">
    <p class="why">问题是连接关系：用 HTML + CSS 就够，不必因为是图就默认 SVG。</p>
    <div class="topo">
      <div class="node"><strong>提示词</strong><small>指向成果、仓库与文件夹</small></div>
      <span class="edge" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="node"><strong>智能体</strong><small>读取上下文，不重复复述</small></div>
      <span class="edge" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="node"><strong>HTML 成果</strong><small>自包含单文件</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fanout">
      <span>同一份成果并行交给</span>
      <div class="chips"><span>设计</span><span>工程</span><span>PM</span></div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="sheet"
    role="tabpanel"
    id="dg-panel-sequence"
    data-panel="sequence"
    aria-labelledby="dg-tab-sequence"
    hidden="until-found"
  >
    <div class="sheet-surface">
    <p class="why">问题是先后次序：改用 SVG 泳道，节点位置保持稳定，便于逐步对照。</p>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 480 190" role="img" aria-label="时序图：提示词发出请求，智能体返回成果，评审者在同一文件上批注，结论回到提示词">
      <g stroke="#ded4c4" stroke-width="1">
        <line x1="80" y1="24" x2="80" y2="172"></line>
        <line x1="240" y1="24" x2="240" y2="172"></line>
        <line x1="400" y1="24" x2="400" y2="172"></line>
      </g>
      <g font-family="system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#17140f" text-anchor="middle">
        <text x="80" y="16">提示词</text>
        <text x="240" y="16">智能体</text>
        <text x="400" y="16">评审者</text>
      </g>
      <g stroke="#17140f" stroke-opacity="0.55" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none">
        <path d="M82 46h154"></path>
        <path d="M242 78h156"></path>
        <path d="M398 110h-156"></path>
        <path d="M238 142h-156"></path>
      </g>
      <g fill="#17140f" fill-opacity="0.55">
        <polygon points="238,46 230,42 230,50"></polygon>
        <polygon points="400,78 392,74 392,82"></polygon>
        <polygon points="240,110 248,106 248,114"></polygon>
        <polygon points="80,142 88,138 88,146"></polygon>
      </g>
      <g font-family="system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#453f36">
        <text x="160" y="40">带上上下文</text>
        <text x="320" y="72">产出成果</text>
        <text x="320" y="104">就地批注</text>
        <text x="160" y="136">结论回到同一处</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .dg { min-width: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); }
    .bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; gap: 6px; overflow-x: auto; }
    .bar button { position: relative; flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 6px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); background: transparent; font: 0.6875rem var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-ink-mute); cursor: pointer; }
    .bar button[aria-selected='true'] { color: var(--color-accent); }
    .bar button[aria-selected='true']::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: auto 0 0; border-block-end: 2px solid var(--color-accent); }
    .sheet { min-width: 0; }
    .sheet-surface { min-width: 0; margin-top: 10px; padding: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); background: #fffdf9; }
    .why { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 0.6875rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-ink-mute); }
    .topo { display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .node { flex: 1 1 110px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); background: var(--color-paper-deep); }
    .node strong { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-ink); }
    .node small { font-size: 0.625rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-ink-mute); }
    .edge { align-self: center; font: 0.875rem var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-accent); }
    .fanout { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-rule); font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--color-ink-mute); }
    .chips { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
    .chips span { padding: 3px 9px; border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--color-ink-soft); }
    svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
    @media (max-width: 35em) {
      .topo { flex-direction: column; }
      .edge { transform: rotate(90deg); }
    }
  </style>
</div>
